Afterlife consolidates and pins work done by others. It does not replace it.
Components below keep their own licenses; check each upstream before redistributing.

  - 1Cat-vLLM: SM70 (V100) vLLM build path.
  - mixa3607: gfx906 (MI50) ROCm/Tensile and container recipes.
  - nlzy: gfx906 vLLM fork.
  - ROCm/TheRock: ROCm nightly builds.
  - Atlas3D: community legacy-GPU work.
  - llama.cpp (ggml-org, MIT): inference engine built for sm_70/sm_61/gfx906.
  - vLLM (Apache-2.0), PyTorch (BSD-3-Clause), Ollama (MIT): referenced as comparison baselines.

